# STORY (Year 1 research + story), batch 3: G.I. Joe research for Year 1.
# Day 1 open list = John's short list (12 Nov 21:10); the rest of the master doc's list opens with the month-3
# Pentagon review (STR_PENTAGON_BUDGET_REVIEW: BUILD grants it from a month-3 event). Done-at-start topics are
# for BUILD's starting research. The items, crafts, facilities and manufacture these open are BUILD's rules.
